This licence covers the *code* in this repository only.

The seismic catalog data this tool processes is published by the Japan
Meteorological Agency under the Public Data License (Version 1.0) and is not
covered by the licence above. This repository redistributes no catalog data;
the tool fetches it into the user's own environment at run time. Two small
test fixtures under `tests/infrastructure/fixtures/` are the sole exception
and are attributed there.

See the "Data provenance and attribution" section of `README.md` for what the
JMA terms require of you when you publish results derived from this data.
